{
  "name": "VendeMais — Lead Enrichment via LLM (v0.3-joana)",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "hubspotcrm:watchDeals",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": 0,
        "limit": 100,
        "watchBy": "updatedDate"
      },
      "mapper": {},
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "restore": {
          "parameters": {
            "__IMTCONN__": {
              "label": "Joana HubSpot Personal (PESSOAL — MIGRAR p/ conta corporativa)",
              "data": { "scoped": "false", "connection": "hubspotcrm" }
            }
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "__IMTCONN__",
            "type": "account:hubspotcrm",
            "label": "Connection",
            "required": true
          }
        ],
        "expect": [
          { "name": "watchBy", "type": "select", "label": "Watch Deals by" },
          { "name": "limit", "type": "uinteger", "label": "Limit" }
        ],
        "advanced": true,
        "note": "Filter dealstage = appointmentscheduled. Schedule era 15min, hoje OFF (Cláudia desligou no fim do ano passado) — roda manual via Run once.",
        "scheduling": {
          "type": "indefinitely",
          "interval": 900,
          "status": "off"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "google-cse:search",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": 0
      },
      "mapper": {
        "cx": "017576662512468239146:omuauf_lfve",
        "q": "{{1.properties.company}} headquarters employees revenue technology stack",
        "num": 5,
        "safe": "off",
        "lr": "lang_pt"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 300, "y": 0 },
        "restore": {
          "parameters": {
            "__IMTCONN__": {
              "label": "Joana Google Custom Search API (key/billing PESSOAIS)",
              "data": { "scoped": "false", "connection": "google-cse" }
            }
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "__IMTCONN__",
            "type": "account:google-cse",
            "label": "Connection",
            "required": true
          }
        ],
        "expect": [
          { "name": "q", "type": "text", "label": "Query" },
          { "name": "cx", "type": "text", "label": "Search engine ID" },
          { "name": "num", "type": "uinteger", "label": "Number of results" }
        ],
        "note": "Sem truncamento dos snippets — vão gigantes pro OpenAI e estouram tokens."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "module": "openai-gpt-3:createChatCompletion",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": 0
      },
      "mapper": {
        "model": "gpt-5.4-mini",
        "temperature": "0.3",
        "max_tokens": "1500",
        "response_format": { "type": "json_object" },
        "messages": [
          {
            "role": "system",
            "content": "Você é um analista de inteligência de vendas B2B. Sempre responde em JSON válido, sem texto antes ou depois."
          },
          {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Você é um analista de inteligência de vendas. Recebeu o nome da empresa: {{1.properties.company}} e os resultados de busca: {{3.items}}. Retorne em JSON:\n{\n  \"industry\": \"...\",\n  \"size_employees\": \"...\",\n  \"tech_stack\": [...],\n  \"buying_signals\": [...],\n  \"icp_match_score\": 0-100,\n  \"talking_points\": [...]\n}"
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 600, "y": 0 },
        "restore": {
          "parameters": {
            "__IMTCONN__": {
              "label": "Joana OpenAI Personal (sk-... no cartão PESSOAL — URGENTE trocar)",
              "data": { "scoped": "false", "connection": "openai-gpt-3" }
            }
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "__IMTCONN__",
            "type": "account:openai-gpt-3",
            "label": "Connection",
            "required": true
          }
        ],
        "expect": [
          { "name": "model", "type": "select", "label": "Model" },
          { "name": "temperature", "type": "number", "label": "Temperature" },
          { "name": "max_tokens", "type": "uinteger", "label": "Max tokens" },
          { "name": "messages", "type": "array", "label": "Messages" }
        ],
        "note": "Sem error handling: se a OpenAI devolve JSON quebrado o cenário morre silencioso. Alternativa: Anthropic Claude (módulo anthropic:createMessage)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "module": "airtable:ActionCreateRecord",
      "version": 3,
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": 0
      },
      "mapper": {
        "base": "appXXXXXXXXXX",
        "table": "Lead Enrichment",
        "record": {
          "deal_id": "{{1.id}}",
          "company_name": "{{1.properties.company}}",
          "industry": "{{3.choices[].message.content.industry}}",
          "size_employees": "{{3.choices[].message.content.size_employees}}",
          "tech_stack": "{{join(3.choices[].message.content.tech_stack; \",\")}}",
          "buying_signals": "{{3.choices[].message.content.buying_signals}}",
          "icp_match_score": "{{3.choices[].message.content.icp_match_score}}",
          "talking_points": "{{3.choices[].message.content.talking_points}}",
          "enriched_at": "{{now}}",
          "raw_search_results": "{{toString(2.items)}}"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 900, "y": 0 },
        "restore": {
          "parameters": {
            "__IMTCONN__": {
              "label": "Joana Airtable PAT (token pessoal, base corporativa)",
              "data": { "scoped": "false", "connection": "airtable" }
            }
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "__IMTCONN__",
            "type": "account:airtable",
            "label": "Connection",
            "required": true
          }
        ],
        "expect": [
          { "name": "base", "type": "text", "label": "Base" },
          { "name": "table", "type": "text", "label": "Table" }
        ],
        "note": "Sem dedup por deal_id — re-enriquecimento cria linha duplicada. tech_stack (Multiple select) explode opções. Falta JSON Parse explícito do choices[0].message.content."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "module": "hubspotcrm:updateDeal",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": 0
      },
      "mapper": {
        "dealId": "{{1.id}}",
        "properties": {
          "icp_match_score": "{{3.choices[].message.content.icp_match_score}}",
          "enrichment_industry": "{{3.choices[].message.content.industry}}",
          "enrichment_last_run": "{{now}}",
          "enrichment_status": "enriched"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": 0 },
        "restore": {
          "parameters": {
            "__IMTCONN__": {
              "label": "Joana HubSpot Personal (mesma conexão do trigger)",
              "data": { "scoped": "false", "connection": "hubspotcrm" }
            }
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "__IMTCONN__",
            "type": "account:hubspotcrm",
            "label": "Connection",
            "required": true
          }
        ],
        "expect": [
          { "name": "dealId", "type": "text", "label": "Deal ID" }
        ],
        "note": "Sem branch de falha: se módulo 3 morre, enrichment_status fica eterno em 'pending' (nunca vira 'failed')."
      }
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": false,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false,
      "slots": null,
      "confidential": false,
      "dataloss": false,
      "dlq": false,
      "freshVariables": false
    },
    "designer": {
      "orphans": []
    },
    "zone": "eu1.make.com",
    "notes": [
      "Esqueleto reconstruído a partir de make-blueprint-pseudo.txt + screenshots (Joana não exportou o blueprint limpo antes de sair).",
      "LIMITAÇÃO MAKE: conexões (__IMTCONN__) NÃO exportam no JSON. Ao importar, reconfigure HubSpot OAuth, Google CSE, OpenAI e Airtable PAT na mão.",
      "Workspace original: Joana Personal (joana@vendemais.com) — PRECISA MIGRAR p/ conta corporativa.",
      "Plano Make Free: 1.000 ops/mês — já estoura. Subir p/ Starter no orçamento aprovado."
    ]
  }
}
